{"id":"3b40125e21710f48","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-syntactic-substitution.md","title":"依赖语境的句法替换","display":"df-syntactic-substitution — 依赖语境的句法替换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-syntactic-substitution","display":"df-syntactic-substitution — 依赖语境的句法替换","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-signature]]"],"source":"§10.2; §10.3, pp. 602–604 (PDF 622–624)","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-df-syntactic-substitution"],"formalization_scope":"Syntactic substitution for the explicit finite strong first-order fragment"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-syntactic-substitution"},{"key":"display","html":"df-syntactic-substitution — 依赖语境的句法替换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.2; §10.3, pp. 602–604 (PDF 622–624)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-syntactic-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"formalization_scope","html":"Syntactic substitution for the explicit finite strong first-order fragment"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a> 的有限强一阶依赖演算及签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t=t&#39;:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t=t&#39;:A\\)</span> 表示其判断。</li>\n<li>该演算的原始类型、项已经按捕获避免的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 换名取商；这些原始树类之间使用元理论等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span>。替换上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv\">\\(\\equiv\\)</span> 仅表示 Assertion 显式定义的逐分量判断相等关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)\">\\(\\Delta=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(y_1:B_1,\\ldots,y_\\ell:B_\\ell)\">\\(\\Gamma=(y_1:B_1,\\ldots,y_\\ell:B_\\ell)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta=(z_1:C_1,\\ldots,z_m:C_m)\">\\(\\Theta=(z_1:C_1,\\ldots,z_m:C_m)\\)</span> 为良构语境；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[\\sigma]\">\\(M[\\sigma]\\)</span> 是同步、捕获避免的句法替换。</li>\n<li>在下式定义的替换集合上，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\sigma^{\\prime}=(t_1^{\\prime},\\ldots,t_n^{\\prime}):\\Gamma\\to\\Delta\">\\(\\sigma=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\sigma^{\\prime}=(t_1^{\\prime},\\ldots,t_n^{\\prime}):\\Gamma\\to\\Delta\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=(s_1,\\ldots,s_m):\\Delta\\to\\Theta\">\\(\\tau=(s_1,\\ldots,s_m):\\Delta\\to\\Theta\\)</span>；其箭头型属只作为各运算的输入限制，不预设复合良型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\quad \\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\{(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\mid(\\forall k=1,\\ldots,n)\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t_k:A_k[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/x_{k-1}]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\quad \\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\{(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\mid(\\forall k=1,\\ldots,n)\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t_k:A_k[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/x_{k-1}]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\equiv\\sigma&#39;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall k=1,\\ldots,n)\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t_k=t&#39;_k:A_k[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/x_{k-1}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\equiv\\sigma&#39;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall k=1,\\ldots,n)\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t_k=t&#39;_k:A_k[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/x_{k-1}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\circ\\sigma\\coloneqq(s_1[\\sigma],\\ldots,s_m[\\sigma]),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma\\coloneqq(y_1,\\ldots,y_\\ell),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau\\circ\\sigma\\coloneqq(s_1[\\sigma],\\ldots,s_m[\\sigma]),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma\\coloneqq(y_1,\\ldots,y_\\ell),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\cup\\mathsf{RawTm}\\mid\n\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\subseteq\\{v\\in V\\mid(\\exists A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy})\\ (v:A)\\in\\operatorname{rng}\\Gamma\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\cup\\mathsf{RawTm}\\mid\n\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\subseteq\\{v\\in V\\mid(\\exists A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy})\\ (v:A)\\in\\operatorname{rng}\\Gamma\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Gamma))\\quad&amp;M[\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma]=M,\\\\\n(\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Theta))\\quad&amp;M[\\tau\\circ\\sigma]=M[\\tau][\\sigma],\\\\\n&amp;\\tau\\circ\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Theta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Gamma))\\quad&amp;M[\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma]=M,\\\\\n(\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Theta))\\quad&amp;M[\\tau\\circ\\sigma]=M[\\tau][\\sigma],\\\\\n&amp;\\tau\\circ\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Theta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>依赖型属必须逐分量代入先前的项；不能只逐个要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_k:A_k\">\\(t_k:A_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>替换引理保证复合良型，判断相等的替换、转换规则保证它对等价类无关；结构归纳证明最后两条定律。</li>\n<li>这是句法操作。纤维重索引函子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a>，二者通过项模型联系，不能共用一个未说明的接口。</li>\n<li>当前入口采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a> 的完整原始语法与结构规则；它没有覆盖原书所有弱/强及高阶演算。类型和项构造节点所携带的型属注释也参与同步、捕获避免替换。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§10.2; §10.3, pp. 602–604 (PDF 622–624)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-dtt-signature]] 的有限强一阶依赖演算及签名 $\\Sigma$，写 $\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A$、$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}$、$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t=t':A$ 表示其判断。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是句法操作。纤维重索引函子见 [[16-df-substitution]]，二者通过项模型联系，不能共用一个未说明的接口。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"当前入口采用 [[16-df-dtt-signature]] 的完整原始语法与结构规则；它没有覆盖原书所有弱/强及高阶演算。类型和项构造节点所携带的型属注释也参与同步、捕获避免替换。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t=t':A","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"=","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=(y_1:B_1,\\ldots,y_\\ell:B_\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta=(z_1:C_1,\\ldots,z_m:C_m)","display":false},{"tex":"M[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\sigma^{\\prime}=(t_1^{\\prime},\\ldots,t_n^{\\prime}):\\Gamma\\to\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=(s_1,\\ldots,s_m):\\Delta\\to\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\quad \\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\{(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\mid(\\forall k=1,\\ldots,n)\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t_k:A_k[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/x_{k-1}]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\equiv\\sigma'\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall k=1,\\ldots,n)\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t_k=t'_k:A_k[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/x_{k-1}].","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau\\circ\\sigma\\coloneqq(s_1[\\sigma],\\ldots,s_m[\\sigma]),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma\\coloneqq(y_1,\\ldots,y_\\ell),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\cup\\mathsf{RawTm}\\mid\n\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\subseteq\\{v\\in V\\mid(\\exists A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy})\\ (v:A)\\in\\operatorname{rng}\\Gamma\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Gamma))\\quad&M[\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma]=M,\\\\\n(\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{Raw}(\\Theta))\\quad&M[\\tau\\circ\\sigma]=M[\\tau][\\sigma],\\\\\n&\\tau\\circ\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Theta).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"t_k:A_k","display":false}],"bytes":3038,"backlinks":[{"id":"42b5ac7685998854","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-syntactic-substitution]] 的依赖演算；上下文、项均按捕获避免的 α 换名识别。"},{"id":"2cbe3d8d855b52d0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma:\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-type-functor]]；$\\Sigma$ 是该页使用的有限强 DTT 展示，所有语法树与商集在同一足够大的 $\\mathcal U$ 中。语法判断与同时替换采用 [[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]。"},{"id":"58c65ff26967e699","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原始类型 $\\mathsf{RawTy}$、判断相等及同时替换采用 [[16-df-syntactic-substitution]] 及其声明的 DTT 演算。$\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle$、$\\tau=\\langle\\Theta,\\Delta,[\\vec b]\\rangle$ 为其带源靶标签的箭头。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"}],"outgoing":["3b1238220cc5942f","ccfbb871fa39931c"]}